Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1028
Function: pythonProcessingInstruction
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyObject_CallMethod uses format "ss" with data. In libxml2, processing instruction data can be NULL (PI without data). Passing NULL to the "s" format will crash.

